  "title": "BridgeBio Oncology Therapeutics (BBOT) to Participate in the 43rd Annual J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference 2025",
  "summary": "TheRas, Inc. d/b/a BridgeBio Oncology Therapeutics (“BBOT” or the “Company”), a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company focused on RAS-pathway malignancies, today announced that the company’s Chief Executive Officer, Eli Wallace, PhD, will provide a company overview at the 43rd Annual J.P. Morgan Healthcare Conference on Thursday, January 16, 2025, at 9:30 a.m. PT, and will host one-on-one investor meetings in San Francisco, CA.",
